        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The company works on a technically high level; heavy machines (excl. building machines) are operated electrically; air is recirculated in closed loop to avoid dust emissions\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the processes: milling, sieving, filtering and storing. One part of the total heating energy for "production" and "administration" is included. Equipment included in the infrastructure: 1 crusher, 1 sieve, and 2 small silos and 1 filter.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
